WEBVTT

00:00.840 --> 00:04.500
Chen Wan'er! If you wish to seek death, don't drag me to the grave with you!

00:07.720 --> 00:10.500
Prince of Jin! We've found His Highness the Prince of Jin!

00:13.200 --> 00:17.000
Father! Your son never harbored the slightest thought of committing such an outrage!

00:17.440 --> 00:21.500
Father?! Every shred of dignity belonging to the Sikong royal house has been utterly dragged through the mud by you!

00:21.920 --> 00:26.500
And now you dare plead innocence?! I'll kick you to death myself, you worthless disgrace!

00:26.840 --> 00:31.840
Father! Even if you granted your son a hundred times more audacity, I would never dare commit such madness!

00:31.960 --> 00:33.000
Get away from me!

00:34.040 --> 00:39.000
Tomorrow? No—pack your belongings this very day and banish yourself to the southern frontier!

00:39.240 --> 00:43.000
Without an imperial summons, you shall not take a single step beyond the border!

00:44.360 --> 00:45.500
As Father commands...

00:47.000 --> 00:53.000
That night, an imperial decree reached your estate, exiling you to the desolate southern frontier, forbidden to return without imperial summons.

00:53.600 --> 01:00.000
Your advisors urged you to obey the imperial decree and depart first, biding your time. Alas, en route to your fief, you crossed paths with a rebel uprising.

01:00.600 --> 01:07.500
They executed you on the spot under the pretext of treason, reporting it only after the deed was done.
